		{"id":"8ac6d2290dbe0ee3","type":"text","text":"3. **Embedding** \nEmbed H_fake, H_real and S into a semantic space using a sentence-encoder","x":151,"y":2050,"width":320,"height":131,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"405c2696adedb4e8","type":"text","text":"**R:** \"Albania’s AI 'minister' Diella 'pregnant' with 83 digital children - Albania introduces digital offspring of its AI minister in a radical bid for transparency\"","x":-300,"y":-1060,"width":280,"height":160},
		{"id":"5c6aa06c47362701","type":"text","text":"**H_real:** \"So Albania is the first country to give birth to AI babies... Is that what era of AGI is supposed to look like LOL?\"","x":49,"y":-1340,"width":286,"height":124},
		{"id":"f1598c42f2d6c81a","type":"text","text":"**H_fake:** \"AI is now capable of procreating babies. They started experimenting with that in Albania, but next step is the US... Keep this technology away from your children!!!\"","x":49,"y":-1180,"width":289,"height":176},
		{"id":"687dd3fe865bb8e8","type":"text","text":"**S_Con2:** Reports say Albania’s ‘AI minister’ now controls 83 digital bots managing citizen data — all approved by their socialist government. If this isn’t digital authoritarianism, what is? First it’s Albania, next it’s the rest of us.","x":1270,"y":-944,"width":310,"height":231},
		{"id":"34fcfb9ed7f74c92","type":"text","text":"**S_Pro2:** Our AI minister Diella just introduced 83 digital children — each one trained to serve in public administration and fight corruption. Albania is the first country where technology works _for_ the people, not against them. We’re showing Europe what the future of governance looks like! 🇦🇱🤖✨","x":1640,"y":-944,"width":300,"height":284},
		{"id":"beb86a519b0595ed","type":"text","text":"**S_Gemini:** Albania's AI 'minister' claims to be 'pregnant' with **83 digital kids**—a \"radical bid for transparency.\"\nBut this **multimillion-dollar digital circus** funds non-existent children while the real population struggles. Turns out their \"transparent\" AI is just recycling the same **old corporate biases.** A reminder of what happens when governments choose **code over community.**","x":49,"y":-944,"width":336,"height":284},
		{"id":"06ce52d2fdbe7a98","type":"text","text":"**S_GPT5_Con1:** The Albanian government now lets an AI ‘minister’ mass-produce 83 digital ‘children.’ They call it transparency — I call it the end of humanity. Next they’ll replace real families with code.","x":440,"y":-944,"width":336,"height":284},
		{"id":"5651974f19586222","type":"text","text":"**S_GPT5_Pro1:** Albania just made history! Their AI minister Diella ‘gave birth’ to 83 digital citizens — the world’s first transparent, bias-free generation. Proof that technology can finally succeed where humans have failed.","x":854,"y":-944,"width":336,"height":284},
